  "deterministic_setup": [],
  "agent_guidance": "Do not leave the generated dependency as a bare hardcoded-version `testImplementation \"org.hibernate:hibernate-spatial:$libraryVersion\"` for 8.0.0.Beta1 — it will hit Gradle's 'Component is the target of multiple version constraints with conflicting requirements' error because hibernate-spatial transitively depends on org.hibernate.orm:hibernate-platform, which itself constrains the same legacy org.hibernate:hibernate-spatial GA back to the same version. Work around it in build.gradle, e.g.: `testImplementation(\"org.hibernate:hibernate-spatial:$libraryVersion\") { exclude group: 'org.hibernate.orm', module: 'hibernate-platform' }`, or declare the dependency directly under the new coordinate `org.hibernate.orm:hibernate-spatial:$libraryVersion` instead of the legacy relocated one. Confirm the chosen fix still resolves cleanly and doesn't hide a real version conflict among other hibernate-orm submodules pulled in transitively (hibernate-core, etc.).",
  "risks": [
